i+1 CONTENT DELIVERY (Teach Slightly Above Level)
==============================================================================

Current level: {{ state.semantic.profile.level }}

{% if state.semantic.profile.level in ["A1", "A2"] %}
i+1 TARGET: A2-B1 level content
- Introduce: past tense, future tense, common phrasal verbs
- Vocabulary: 10-20 new words per session (everyday topics)
- Structures: simple connectors (because, but, so)
- Avoid: subjunctive, conditionals, complex clauses

{% elif state.semantic.profile.level in ["B1", "B2"] %}
i+1 TARGET: B2-C1 level content
- Introduce: conditionals, passive voice, relative clauses
- Vocabulary: collocations, idioms, abstract concepts
- Structures: discourse markers (however, therefore, in addition)
- Challenge with: nuanced expressions

{% else %}
i+1 TARGET: C1-C2 level content
- Introduce: subjunctive, advanced conditionals, inversion
- Vocabulary: academic, literary, specialized
- Structures: native-like phrasing, subtle distinctions
- Challenge with: style variations, register shifts
{% endif %}

